Built-in Modules:
-------------------
If Python provides, then it is called as Built-in modules
1. Math : It is used to perform mathematical calculations
    1.sqrt( ) : Used to get square root value
    2.ceil() : Used to get round up then value
    3.floor(): Used to get round down the value
    4.factorial(): Used to get factorial of a given number
1. Math 
-------
1.sqrt( )
---------
import math
n=eval(input("Enter the value"))
s=math.sqrt(n)
print(f"Square root value : {s}")

Output
------
Enter the value 2
Square root value : 1.4142135623730951

2.ceil()
--------
import math
n=eval(input("Enter the value: "))
c=math.ceil(n)
print(f"Ceil value : {c}")

Output
------
Enter the value:2.5
Ceil value : 3

3.floor():
----------
import math
n=eval(input("Enter the value: "))
f=math.floor(n)
print(f"floor value : {f}")

Output
------
Enter the value:2.6
floor value : 2

4.factorial()
-------------
import math
n=eval(input("Enter the value: "))
f=math.factorial(n)
print(f"factorial of {n} is : {f}")

Output
------
Enter the value:5
factorial of 5 is : 120

